  The x230's parser has no `stack-fabric` and no `all` (the wiki's syntax, DITA/x230/swi_cmd/platform_prbs_ak.dita, is
  `platform prbs {internal-fabric|stack-fabric|all-fabric} [duration <seconds>]`). The case's `platform prbs all duration 20`
  therefore maps to `platform prbs all-fabric duration 20` (the dispatch's instruction; same meaning: every fabric link).

